;                        T H E   D O G - L E G   C R O S S I N G
; You cannot run this gate, and that is the rebuild. The road comes up from the town at x = -6 (the
; town hub's Kingsway leaves at world x = -6, so the two line up across the seam), is turned EAST at
; z = 14 by the palisade line, crosses the whole width of the Holding Yard under the wardens' eyes,
; and only then reaches a gate gap that is 20 m from where it entered. North of the gate it dog-legs
; back west to leave at x = 0, where wilds_north's road begins.
