; --- The search and the impound (Phase 38O) --------------------------------------
; Two MORE bodies, four metres up the road from the permit and the bribe, and the reason is 38M's own
; and not a new one: GetComponent<T> returns the first child match (38E), so a search and a redemption
; stacked on Alric would leave the second one silent forever. Four services, four people.
;
; ⚠️ THE SEARCH IS THE ONLY REASON HOLLOWREACH IS A JOURNEY RATHER THAN A SHOP. Contraband bought or
; looted on the wrong side of this gate can be taken off the player here, and bought back at the shed
; behind — a cost the player can price, not a punishment they cannot. ContrabandImpound holds it and
; the save carries it.
;
; They are dressed apart on purpose, as the first two were: Deryn wears the guild body every official
; in the realm wears, because she IS the same office as Alric standing beside her; the clerk wears the
; townswoman, because a ledger and a counter are not a warden's job and should not look like one.
; Neither wears npc_townsman — that body is a hi-vis vest and a hard hat, retired since 38L.
;
; They are NOT parented to Nav: only static geometry should carve the navmesh.
